Use that $Rf_*\omega _{X/S}^\bullet = Rf_*R\mathop{\mathcal{H}\! \mathit{om}}\nolimits _{\mathcal{O}_ X}(\mathcal{O}_ X. \omega _{X/S}^\bullet ) = R\mathop{\mathcal{H}\! \mathit{om}}\nolimits _{\mathcal{O}_ S}(Rf_*\mathcal{O}_ X, \mathcal{O}_ S)$ by Duality for Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/0E58" data-tag="0E58">86.3.3</a> and Remark <a href="/tag/0GG4" data-tag="0GG4">86.3.5</a> and then that $\omega _{X/S}^\bullet = \omega _{X/S}[1]$ by our definitions in Section <a href="/tag/0E6N" data-tag="0E6N">109.19</a>.